---
import { links } from '../data/gaap';
import Arrow from './Arrow.astro';
import Flower from './Flower.astro';
import Media from './Media.astro';
---
<section class="hero container" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow hero-eyebrow"><span class="tiny-spark" aria-hidden="true">✳</span> pequenos encontros. grandes afetos.</p>
    <h1 id="hero-title"><span class="hero-title-line">Pequenas</span><span class="hero-title-line">vidas<span class="title-stop">.</span></span><em>Grandes recomeços.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-description" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:180ms">Somos o GAAP. Resgatamos e acolhemos porquinhos-da-índia em São Paulo, conectando pequenas vidas a novos lares.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:260ms"><a class="button button-purple" href={links.support} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apoiar no Apoia.se <Arrow diagonal /></a><a class="text-link" href="#historias">Conhecer as histórias <Arrow /></a></div>
    <div class="hero-footnote"><span class="little-line" aria-hidden="true"></span><p>Cuidado que acolhe.<br />Adoção que transforma.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-visual" data-parallax="24">
    <div class="hero-photo-shell"><Media mediaId="hero" class="hero-photo" eager fallbackTitle="Pequenos protagonistas. Histórias de verdade." /><span class="photo-corner" aria-hidden="true">com amor, GAAP</span></div>
    <div class="hero-seal"><Flower /><span>todo<br /><em>cuidado</em><br />importa</span></div>
    <div class="hero-mini"><Media mediaId="bella" class="hero-mini-photo" /><span>um mundo em um pequeno colo.</span></div>
    <svg class="hero-scribble" viewBox="0 0 160 100" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 57C47 3 73 106 107 58s-22-75-27-19c-4 49 38 60 69 27m-18-10 19 10-2 21" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" /></svg>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="chapter-ribbon" aria-hidden="true"><div><span>Resgatar</span><span>✳</span><span>Acolher</span><span>✳</span><span>Cuidar</span><span>✳</span><span>Recomeçar</span><span>✳</span><span>Resgatar</span><span>✳</span><span>Acolher</span><span>✳</span><span>Cuidar</span><span>✳</span><span>Recomeçar</span><span>✳</span></div></div>
